## Netflix Internal Developer Platform (IDP)

![Image](https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize%3Afit%3A2000/1%2AWen2M8BgqhC7Hacc1O2Nqg.png)

![Image](https://miro.medium.com/1%2A0MHo_ywcTvh1IVjf1h9ezA.jpeg)

